ook into the immersive VR experience designed to elevate your skills and knowledge.\nTest drive the realistic simulation:\nExplore a virtual port: Step into a lifelike port environment and get a feel for operating cranes with accurate controls and physics.\nTry essential maneuvers: Practice basic cargo handling, loading, and unloading procedures in a safe and controlled setting.\nGet a taste of advanced training: Experience a preview of the challenging scenarios and skill-building exercises available in the full version.\n\nReady to take your training to the next level?\nContact us at contact@octav.studio to learn more about the full version of Crane Simulation and how it can benefit your organization.\n", "short_description": "Crane Simulation offers a realistic VR experience for aspiring crane operators. Practice essential maneuvers and explore a virtual port environment with accurate controls and physics. Take your training to the next level!\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Octav Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://octav.studio/Privacy%20Policy%20for%20Crane%20Simulation.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Octav Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://octav.studio/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8226905614102010"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.o